c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a941667080eb136f\" href=\"?note=a941667080eb136f\" title=\"73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl\">73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9b2a2a92345299bc\" href=\"?note=9b2a2a92345299bc\" title=\"73-ex-indexed-equal-three-blocks\">73-ex-indexed-equal-three-blocks</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Theorem 14.7(b), p. 390; scan 398; epsilon correction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-stated-without-proof; statement-compared"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 14.7(b), p. 390; scan 398; epsilon correction"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"source-stated-without-proof; statement-compared"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>。三类语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"683388600cf59838\" href=\"?note=683388600cf59838\" title=\"73-df-indexed-language\">73-df-indexed-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a941667080eb136f\" href=\"?note=a941667080eb136f\" title=\"73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl\">73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl</a>；严格性的三块见证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9b2a2a92345299bc\" href=\"?note=9b2a2a92345299bc\" title=\"73-ex-indexed-equal-three-blocks\">73-ex-indexed-equal-three-blocks</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language\\text{-}containments}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language\\text{-}containments}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language\\text{-}containments}\\vdash\n|\\Sigma|\\ge3\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\subsetneq\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}language\\text{-}containments}\\vdash\n|\\Sigma|\\ge3\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\subsetneq\\mathsf{IND}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>CFG 只用普通指标规则即可嵌入。指标语言包含于 CSL 是原书定理 14.7(b) 明确“不加证明”陈述的结果；由于本笔记允许指标文法生成 ε，而本书 CSL 排除 ε，形式结论用了已定义的空词扩展。该包含未在本笔记内补齐完整证明，证据限制保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-indexed-language","status":"resolved","id":"683388600cf59838","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-indexed-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location